* *"How should we best coordinate my treatment plan between you, my PCP (Dr. Kim), my endocrinologist (Dr. Lee), and the specialists at Seattle Heart?"*

*Disclaimer: I am an AI, not a doctor. Please ensure you discuss all symptoms, medication side effects, and lab results directly with your healthcare providers.* 

