> *"I am experiencing shortness of breath. Could my current medications (omeprazole, calcium, vitamin D) be contributing to this? Also, can we review my asthma treatment plan to make sure I am on the correct medications?"*

**3. Investigating Joint Pain & Tests:**
> *"I've been having frequent joint pain. Is this related to my other conditions, and can you confirm what the recent MRI order is specifically looking for?"*

**4. Referrals and Next Steps:**
> *"I have a referral to Seattle Heart. Is this to investigate my shortness of breath? How will my care be coordinated between you, my PCP (Dr. Kim), my endocrinologist (Dr. Lee), and the cardiology team?"*

