* *"Could we review my recent lab results from Seton Medical Center? I want to make sure I correctly understand my TSH levels, my blood pressure, and my recent HbA1c reading."*
* *"I've been experiencing shortness of breath. Could this be related to my asthma, a potential heart issue (regarding my referral to Seattle Heart), or could it be a side effect of my current medications, including omeprazole?"*
* *"Can we clarify my current medication list? I want to ensure I am taking the right treatments for my asthma versus my bone health/supplements."*
* *"Could you explain what the upcoming MRI is specifically looking for in relation to my joint pain?"*

